Package: thinkthen
Type: Package
Title: Typed Questions About Text
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ian", "Maurer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "imaurer@gmail.com")
Description: Judge text and structured records with typed questions. The native
    engine supplies decisions, labels, scores, names and relations. Calls use
    ordinary R vectors and data frames, with coded error conditions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: tibble, dplyr, data.table
SystemRequirements: Rust, Cargo, C compiler
URL: https://github.com/botassembly/thinkthen
BugReports: https://github.com/botassembly/thinkthen/issues
